OL,3,AUS to blacklist Asian AI firm Megaspeed
OL,4,Aafter Nvidia scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has said it intends to ban a
OL,7,FSingaporean artificial intelligence
OL,8,F(AI) company allegedly tied to the
OL,9,FNvidia scandal from doing business in
OL,10,FAmerica.
OL,12,FThe US Department of Commerce announced
OL,13,Fon Monday that it planned to add
OL,14,FMegaspeed Ltd to a list of entities
OL,15,Fthat are blacklisted from buying or
OL,16,Fselling goods in the US.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
