OL,3,AUS to blacklist Asian AI firm Megaspeed
OL,4,Aafter Nvidia scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company is mainly a developer of
OL,7,Fdata centres, but in recent weeks, a
OL,8,Fformer executive of Megaspeed was
OL,9,Faccused of working as spy for China
OL,10,Fwhile having a romantic relationship
OL,11,Fwith Nvidia head Jensen Huang.
OL,13,FThe relationship led to additional
OL,14,Fscrutiny by US officials and heightened
OL,15,Fconcern that Megaspeed was funneling
OL,16,FNvidia's advanced AI computer chips to
OL,17,FChina.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
